  "content": "<p>Weak magnitude 2.1 earthquake at 8 km depth</p>\n    <p><i>31 Oct 23:10 UTC</i>: First to report: JMA after 6 hours.</p>\n    \n\n\n    \n    \n        \n            <p>I didn't feel it</p>\n            <p>I felt this quake</p>\n        \n        <h2>Earthquake details</h2>\n        <table>\n\n            <tbody><tr><td>Date &amp; time</td><td>Oct 31, 2026 17:29:00 UTC<b> - </b></td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Local time at epicenter</td><td>Sunday, <b>Nov 1, 2026, at 02:29 am</b> (GMT +9)</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Status</td><td>preliminary (automatic detection)</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Magnitude</td><td><b>2.1</b></td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Depth</td><td>8 km</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Epicenter latitude / longitude</td><td><a href=\"https://www.volcanodiscovery.com/earthquakes/latlng/23.8/122.6/100/3d.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">23.814°N / 122.599°E</a>  <b><a href=\"https://www.volcanodiscovery.com/earthquakes/japan.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Japan</a></b><p>Also near:  <a href=\"https://www.volcanodiscovery.com/earthquakes/taiwan.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Taiwan</a> 100 km (62 mi) away</p></td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Seismic antipode</td><td><a href=\"https://www.volcanodiscovery.com/earthquakes/latlng/-23.8/-57.4/500/3d.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">23.814°S / 57.401°W</a> <a href=\"https://www.volcanodiscovery.com/earthquakes/paraguay.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Paraguay</a></td></tr>\n            \n            <tr><td>Shaking intensity</td><td><b>II</b> Very weak shaking</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Felt</td><td>0 reports</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Primary data source</td><td><a href=\"https://www.jma.go.jp/bosai/map.html#4/34/135/&amp;contents=hypo\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">JMA</a> (Japan Meteorological Agency)</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Nearest volcano</td><td><a href=\"https